# The prompt store is local and private, and stays that way.
#
# This repository is public. Prompts routinely carry strategy material, private
# paths and third-party context, and HANDOFF.md already records why strategy
# documents are kept off-tree. The run record carries the sha256 of every
# prompt, so a clone can verify a prompt has not changed and cannot read it.
# That asymmetry is deliberate and is documented in RUN-TELEMETRY.md.
prompts/*
!prompts/.gitkeep

# Working scratch from `python -m telemetry wrap`.
*.tmp

# Per-session state written by the opt-in hooks (maps a live session to its
# open run so the Stop hook can close it). Machine state, never a record.
.active/
